[31m-## 2. Adding a New Page[m
[31m-[m
[31m-1. **Create a Markdown file** inside the project root.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-   Filename = slug (e.g. `my-topic.md`).[m
[31m-[m
[31m-2. **Front matter template**[m
[31m-[m
[31m-   ```[m
[31m-   ---[m
[31m-   layout: page          # keep as “page” so Minima uses the full-width layout[m
[31m-   title:  "My Topic"    # displayed in browser tab and h1[m
[31m-   permalink: /my-topic/ # clean URL → http://…/my-topic/[m
[31m-   ---[m
[31m-   ```[m
[31m-[m
[31m-3. **Write content** below the front matter in regular Markdown.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-4. **Decide whether it appears in the top-right navigation**[m
[31m-   - Header links are listed manually in `_config.yml → header_pages:`.[m
[31m-   - To **show** the page, add its filename there.[m
[31m-   - To **hide** the page, do nothing; the page is still reachable via its permalink.[m
