[31m-## 3. Images & Downloads[m
[31m-[m
[31m-- Put assets in `images/` and link relatively: `![Alt text](/images/diagram.png){: width="60%"}`[m
[31m-[m
[31m-- Large binaries (PDFs, ZIPs) go in `files/` to keep the repo lean, but for non-embedded files it is recommended to use a link to an external website for download[m
