[31m-## 4. Working Branches & Deployment[m
[31m-[m
[31m-1. **Work on feature branches**: `git checkout -b my-feature`[m
[31m-2. **Test locally**: Always run `jekyll serve` inside `nix develop` and verify your changes work.[m
[31m-3. **Commit logically**: `git add file.md; git commit -am "Add My Topic page"`[m
[31m-4. **Push your branch**: `git push origin my-feature`[m
[31m-5. **Merge when ready**: `git checkout main; git merge my-feature; git push origin main`[m
[31m-6. **Deploy automatically**: GitHub Pages builds and deploys within ~10 minutes after pushing to `main`.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-**Note**: You can also work directly on `main` for small changes, but use branches for substantial additions to avoid breaking the live site.[m
[31m-[m
