[31m-## 5. Troubleshooting[m
[31m-[m
[31m-| Symptom                           | Fix                                                                    |[m
[31m-| --------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |[m
[31m-| `nix` command not found           | Ensure Nix is installed and added to your PATH.                        |[m
[31m-| Infinite Sass “import loop” error | Never name files `_sass/minima.scss`; instead edit `assets/main.scss`. |[m
[31m-| 404 on a link                     | Link to `/my-topic/` or `my-topic.html`, **not** `my-topic.md`.        |[m
